// 12 - AUTO PIPE SIZING
// THE FLOOR OF EXAMPLE 11, WITH THE CROSS MAIN AND BRANCH LINES GIVEN
// SIZE 0: PHCP SIZES THEM.  THE SMALLEST PIPES THAT WILL DO, KEEPING
// 10% UNDER THE SUPPLY AND NO SIZED PIPE OVER 6 M/S.  AFTER A CALCULATION
// IN THE EDITOR, EACH SIZE IS WRITTEN AFTER ITS LINE AS //AS - <SIZE>.

TITLE     AUTO PIPE SIZING EXAMPLE
UNITS     FLOW LPM
UNITS     PRESSURE KPA
UNITS     LENGTH M
UNITS     SIZE MM
UNITS     ELEVATION M
UNITS     KFACTOR LPM/BAR
OPTION    SIZING_GOAL SMALLEST
OPTION    SIZING_MARGIN 10%

WATER     TOWN 0 450 1000 380 2000 250

NODE      R0 0
NODE      R1 4
NODE      J1 4
NODE      J2 4
SPRINKLER A1 4 -100 80
NC        A1 A2 A3 A4 B1 B2 B3 B4
HREEL     HR1 1 20 30

USE       ASAM
PIPE      M1  TOWN R0 30 100
PIPE      RS  R0 R1 4 100 E
PIPE      H1  R1 J1 10 80 T
PIPE      H2  J1 J2 40 0
PIPE      HRP R0 HR1 5 25

PIPE      LA1 J1 A1 3 0 T
PIPE      LA2 A1 A2 3 0
PIPE      LA3 A2 A3 3 0
PIPE      LA4 A3 A4 3 0
PIPE      LB1 J2 B1 3 0 T
PIPE      LB2 B1 B2 3 0
PIPE      LB3 B2 B3 3 0
PIPE      LB4 B3 B4 3 0
